<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, the blessed rest it brings us</l><l>To belong to Christ alone;</l><l>We can draw on all His fulness</l><l>When we’ve nothing of our own.</l><l>Blessed Jesus, take me, own me,</l><l>Make me, keep me wholly Thine.</l><l>Deign to find in me Thy portion,</l><l>While I joy to call Thee mine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Weary soul, give up the struggle,</l><l>Cease at length thyself to own;</l><l>Give yourself away to Jesus,</l><l>And belong to Him alone.</l><l>Once He gave His all to win thee,</l><l>Now He asks as much of thee;</l><l>All He has He fully gives thee;</l><l>Let thy love His portion be.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
